MB49-I tumors subcutaneously implanted in male mice (n = 8); volume is expressed in mm<sup>3</sup> and corresponds to the mean for each group of mice. (<bold>B</bold>) Body weight measurements in different treated subgroups of male mice; data is expressed in grams and correspond to the mean for each group of mice. Error bars represent &#x000b1; SEM. * <italic toggle="yes">p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.05 and ** <italic toggle="yes">p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.01 denote significant differences compared with the vehicle control group. (<bold>C</bold>) Representative images showing MB49-I tumors that were surgically recovered at endpoint (day 27 after tumor implantation).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="molecules-30-04035-g003" position="float"/></fig><table-wrap position="float" id="molecules-30-04035-t001"><object-id pub-id-type="pii">molecules-30-04035-t001_Table 1</object-id><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Structure of hydrazide derivatives <bold>1&#x02013;23</bold>.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th colspan="6" align="center" valign="middle" style="border-top:solid thin;border-bottom:solid thin" rowspan="1">
